
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>AYT METAL | Sakarya Geyve</title>
<meta name="description" content="AYT METAL Sakarya Geyve. Demir doğrama, ferforje, lazer kapı, çelik ve çit sistemleri.">
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
body{font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background:#111;color:#fff;line-height:1.6}
header{background:#080808;padding:20px;text-align:center;border-bottom:3px solid #d89b24}
.logo{font-size:34px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:3px;color:#e5a72e}
.logo span{color:white}
nav{padding:12px;text-align:center;background:#191919}
nav a{color:white;text-decoration:none;margin:0 10px;font-size:14px}
.hero{padding:85px 20px;text-align:center;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#111,#343434)}
.hero h1{font-size:42px;color:#e5a72e;margin-bottom:15px}
.hero p{font-size:19px;margin-bottom:25px}
.btn{display:inline-block;background:#d99b27;color:#111;padding:13px 25px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold;border-radius:5px}
section{padding:55px 20px;text-align:center}
h2{font-size:29px;color:#e5a72e;margin-bottom:25px}
.services{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:18px;max-width:1000px;margin:auto}
.service{background:#242424;padding:28px 15px;border-bottom:3px solid #d99b27;border-radius:6px}
.service h3{font-size:20px;margin-bottom:8px}
.service p{color:#ccc;font-size:14px}
.about{background:#1b1b1b}
.about p{max-width:750px;margin:auto;color:#ddd;font-size:17px}
.contact{background:#292929}
.contact p{margin:10px;font-size:17px}
footer{background:#080808;text-align:center;padding:22px;color:#aaa}
footer strong{color:#e5a72e}
.whatsapp{position:fixed;bottom:20px;right:18px;background:#20b85a;color:white;padding:13px 18px;border-radius:30px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold}
@media(max-width:500px){
.hero h1{font-size:32px}
nav a{margin:0 5px;font-size:12px}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
<div class="logo">AYT <span>METAL</span></div>
<p>METALİN SANATA DÖNÜŞTÜĞÜ ADRES</p>
</header>

